\begin_layout Standard
This Mega2.BATCH file (as they all do) begins with a rather long comment
 indicating the keyword values that may be set and their default value.
 Toward the end, it will select the inputs as Mega2r.ped and Mega2r.map, indicate
 the input is PLINK ped with parameters and indicate that Mega2 should produce
 a database called seqsimr.db:
\end_layout

